window.products.push({"id":366020,"name":"Gnomes Christmas Tree Topper with Light String Remote Decorations Gifts, 32inch Large Plush Dwarf Xmas Ornaments Closet Home Holiday Party Decor Handm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jc2-YRlnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄SUPER UNIQUE AND VALUE CHRISTMAS TREE TOPPER DECORATIONS: This red white striped gnomes ornaments adopt traditional dwarf shape, which has adjustable knitted pattern hat, snow white plush body and beard, cute stuffed hands and Long legs. Equipped with string lights and remote control, built-in spring for compressible and convenient storage. It's an indispensable Christmas tree topper decor for your house, and a lovable doll toy for children. Perfect Christmas gift for your family and friends 🎁ADJUSTABLE LIGHT STRING WITH REMOTE CONTROL: Comes with a detachable 30-meter long light string and 30 durable light beads. 8 different light modes, dimmable and with timer(include 3 AA batteries). You can choose the light mode and brightness according to your needs, adjust it remotely without taking down the gnome from Christmas tree. Timing function makes you enjoy the beautiful light freely and won't waste electricity. Relax and feel the romantic, warm festive atmosphere with your family 🎄CUTOUT DESIGN AND BUILT-IN SPRING: The hollow body allows this dwarf ornament can be placed on top of any size Christmas tree. You can do poses with the gnome's hand and leg to make decor more personalized and fun. The soft plush and non-woven fabric fully wraps the hollow wire, so you won't worry about wire scratching hands, you can safely give the gnome to children for play. Built-in high-quality springs make it compressed and only need a small space for storage when you want to put it away 🎁PREMIUM MATERIALS AND OVERSIZE: Made of high quality knitted fabric and soft plush, 100% handmade. Classic Christmas elements and festive color give your home a fairytale feel. It's 32 inches high from feet bottom to the top of hat and 10 inches wide. Oversize and lightweight hollow design make it not only be ornaments for Christmas tree, but also perfect decor for closet, bookshelf, desktop, sill, bedside and so on. It will definitely be a surprise and eye- attracted decoration for your house 🎄BEST CHRISTMAS GIFT OPTION: Gnome, which is also called Tomte, or Nisse. In folklore, gnome guard homes and protect people from misfortune. It brings good luck to the family and is regarded as a symbol of good luck, health, happiness and so on. You can give it as gift to your family, neighbors and friends to express your blessings. Note: Each gnome will be completely checked before shipping. If any problem with the gnome you have, please contact us. We will quickly send a replacement or refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jc2-YRlnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIREOR","source_asin":"B0BKGCNQCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKGCNQCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKGCNQCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
