window.products.push({"id":366134,"name":"Ergocell Kitchen Anti Fatigue Mat - Memory Foam Kitchen Mat - Ergonomically Engineered Standing Desk Mat for at Home & Office - Black – 20\" x 39\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZBchC3EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergocell Anti-Fatigue Kitchen Mats- Promoting Safety and Comfort both at Home and Work. We are dedicated to providing vigorously tested, premium products for your home and office. Say goodbye to tired joints or muscle pain from standing with our premium quality anti fatigue mats. The ultimate in standing comfort, these pads have been ergonomically engineered to reduce the pressure to joints caused by standing for long periods of time. Comprised of a single polyurethane gel foam inner layer, the mat structure cradles and supports the feet to reduce stress placed on pressure points in the ankles and knees. The single foam layer stays intact for years to come, unlike most padding made up of several layers fused together. Standing on hard floors can cause poor circulation which leads to muscle fatigue; the buoyancy of this protective mat encourages subtle contraction of the lower and upper leg muscles, alleviating fatigue and pain over prolonged periods of time. By reducing the pressure caused to the lower joints and muscles, this will in turn relieve pressure from the pelvis and lumbar spinal region which work hard to support your body; therefore significantly reducing the risk of lower back pain from standing.These safety mats will also work well to reduce pain from kneeling, supporting the patellar region in a similar way to the foot joints. Features at a glance: - Material: Waterproof, non slip memory foam- Thickness: 0.4\"- Stain Resistant- Waterproof- Non-slip, excellent grip- Free from harmful chemicals, non-toxic, odor free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZBchC3EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergocell","source_asin":"B07P8WCR1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P8WCR1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P8WCR1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
