window.products.push({"id":366226,"name":"Modern Stainless Steel Measuring Cups and Spoons Set 12 Pcs, 5 Measuring Cups, 5 Measuring Spoons, 1 bonus leveler, 1 Coffee Scoop with Clip, Ingredie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9DTSheGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Xthuge Measuring Cups & Spoons Set Make a Big Difference in the Cooking Process and Result 1.Made of food-grade stainless steel, rustproof and BPA-free. 2.Engraved with fadeless size markings on handles in metric and U.S. units. 3.5 measuring cups and 5 measuring spoons meet your different needs. 4.Stackable design saves space and keep the kitchen neat and tidy. 5.Suitable for measuring both dry and liquid ingredients. Features： Material: stainless steel Color: silver 12 Pcs Measuring Tools for Dry & Liquid Ingredients 5 Measuring Cup: 1/8CUP 30mL，1/4CUP 60mL，1/3CUP 80mL，1/2CUP 125mL，1CUP 250mL 5 Measuring Spoon: 1/8TSP 0.5mL，1/4TSP 1.25mL，1/2TSP 2.5mL，1 TSP 5mL，1 TBSP 15mL 3 Additional Tools: 1*Coffee Scoop with Bag Clip 1*Multi-bonus Leveler Powerful Performance uses： Dry & Liquid Use Made of Food-Grade premium stainless steel,100% rust-resistant, no toxic elements, which is safe to use for both dry and wet ingredients Dishwasher Safe The stainless steel measuring cups and spoons set are Rust-proof and BPA Free,simply wash by hand with soap and warm water or load them into the dishwasher for fast clean up. Measuring Engraved Every cup and spoon in this set has the accurate measurements size in US and Metric engraved on the handle clearly, what will help you reduce any measuring errors for cooking or backing! Coffee Scoop with Bag Clip Great for scooping ground coffee and cocoa. The coffee scoop with clip keep coffee fresh and tasting great by sealing the bag after use, The sealing clip uses a strong spring, the seal is more rigid and it is not easy to slip off. Multi-Purpose Leveler Also made from food-grade stainless steel, it provides equal standards when you're cutting and dividing cakes, bread and other foods. You can also use it to mix ingredients while cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9DTSheGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xthuge","source_asin":"B08HWXVB82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HWXVB82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HWXVB82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
