window.products.push({"id":366237,"name":"DEXSA Virtuous Woman Wood Plaque - Made in the USA - 6x9 - Classy Vertical Frame Wall & Tabletop Decoration | Easel & Hanging Hook | She is worth far ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FLAQDCDJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Wood Plaque - by Dexsa - Quality Products for Home Wall Decoration that Enlightens and Inspires Life ⮩ The Perfect Piece of Art that can be hung on the wall or stand nicely on your tabletop. ⯀ Inspirational Quotes on the Plaque “A Virtuous Woman-She is worth far more than rubies. Her husband has full confidence in her She is clothed with strength and dignity, she can laugh at the days to come. She speaks with wisdom, and faithful instruction is on her tongue. She watches over the affairs of her household Her children arise and call her blessed; her husband also, and he praises her; Many women do noble things, but you surpass them all. Charm is deceptive, and beauty is fleeting; but a woman who fears the LORD is to be praised. Proverbs 31:10-30” The words are beautifully painted on a reclaimed wood background. ⯀ Made at its Finest When you talk about quality, our frames are made in the USA and carefully handcrafted into perfection, made of wood that looks so rustic with its reclaimed wood texture and style. ⯀ Easy To Decorate Our frame measures 6\" x 9\" and weighs only 0.95 pounds with hanging metal hook and wide, stable easel in the back to stay standing on the desk, countertop, or other table inside your home. Or hang it in your living room, bedroom or wherever you want to place it that compliments your style. ⯀ Dexsa Dedication Dexsa Ltd. has been manufacturing unique products for the gift market for over twenty-five years. Each piece is handcrafted to ensure that you are receiving the quality you deserve at an affordable price. ⯀ The Perfect Gift - A simple yet fancy gift for any occasion; birthdays, holidays, Christmas, etc.  - A perfect addition to your other Dexsa Products. Click the ADD TO CART and decorate your home with this Dexsa Wood Plaque Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FLAQDCDJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dexsa","source_asin":"B01BKSFMZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BKSFMZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BKSFMZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":366238,"name":"Artdix Roman Shades Blinds Window Shades - Grey 45 W x 60L Inches (1 Piece) Blackout Faux Linen Solid Thermal Fabric Custom Made Roman Shades for Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aA-Z1ypkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to measure Inside mount Window Width: To find the width, measure the top, middle and bottom within your window recess. Use the narrowest width as your window width. Window Length: To find the length, measure exact window-recess length at left, middle and right side. Use the longest height as the window length. Window Depth: Minimum 2 inches required. Ordering: Choose a width that is 1/4 inch smaller than the widow width from above. Choose a length that is same or longer than your window length. Outside mount Determine where the roman shade is to be placed. You will need a minimum 7/8 inches of flat mounting space above your window to accommodate the mounting hardware. Width: Choose a roman blind width that is same or greater than the window width. We recommend add 3-6 inches extra to the measured width to maximize light control and privacy. Length: Measure exact measured-length from the top of the proposed headrail location to the base of sill. If there is no sill, measure where you would like the window roman blind to drop. Add 8-10 inches to the length for optimum light control and privacy. Ordering: Choose a width that is same or wider than the product width from above.  Choose a length that is same or longer than your measured length. How to Get a Custom Roman Shade 1. Get the mount type (inside or outside mount) according to your window type 2. Get the roman shade size according to above measurement method 3. Email us the following information 3.1 Product you like (you can send us LINK or ASIN)  3.2 Mount type 3.3 Roman shade size 4. We give you the price and order link 5. Receive the roman shade, if have any problem, please send message to us or call us, we can solve any problem together with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aA-Z1ypkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B07TSJWV5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TSJWV5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TSJWV5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
