window.products.push({"id":366250,"name":"Slice N Fun Cutting Boards for Kitchen and Meal Prep, Adaptive Plastic Chopping Board, Kid safe with Vegetable Holder, Non-slip, One handed, with Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sMCqE4AWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFE FOOD PREP: The Slice N Fun cutting board allows you to safely hold vegetables, fruits, & other foods while chopping, dicing, & slicing to prepare meals! While using the fork holders, your food will stay in place and your knife won’t slip and injure your fingers. It is designed to promote safety in the kitchen. STAYS IN PLACE: No more chasing your plastic cutting board all over the counter! Our cutting board for kitchen use features 4 suction cups on the bottom that will hold it in place while you prepare food. This makes food prep easier and much safer! PREMIUM FOOD GRADE MATERIALS: All parts of the Slice N Fun kitchen cutting board are made from high-quality materials tested to meet stringent requirements and are safe for food prep use. The fork holders are made from rust-free 304 stainless steel and the plastic parts are BPA free. CONVENIENT VALUE SET: COMMIS CHEF - In addition to the plastic cutting board, you will receive an herb stripper, suction cups and an ingredient prep tray. The chopping boards have a drip tray to collect juices, too. The Crinkle cutter, the Acacia wood cutting board, Nylon brush and the cutting board with pins are NOT included in this set. Our Chef De Partie set is more user-friendly for Stroke patients. EXCELLENT GIFT: These one-of-a-kind cutting boards for kitchen make a unique gift for the sous chef in your life! Our cutting board with tray is perfect for a housewarming gift! The food chopping board is great to teach kids safe food prep, too! WATCH VIDEO: Watch the product explainer video titled \"Slice N Fun | unboxing & suction cup assembly\" shown second, to understand how it goes together. WASH & CARE: All parts are dishwasher safe except for the base with the fork holders. Use the Nylon brush (included with the Chef De Partie) to easily wash the forks without removing the base. For the dishwasher settings: Use Top rack, Short wash cycle, Hi Temp: OFF.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sMCqE4AWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slice N Fun","source_asin":"B08GLJ92TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GLJ92TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GLJ92TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
