window.products.push({"id":366291,"name":"P&P CHEF Baking Racks for Cooking, 2-Pack 16.6 Inch Cooling Rack, Stainless Steel Grid Rack Cooling Rack for Even Cook, Oven & Dishwasher Safe, Fit in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O-zjiVa9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"P&P CHEF Stainless Steel Grid Baking Rack Set of 2 , which is made of high quality pure stainless steel without any toxic coating. It is healthy and safe for your daily baking use. Both racks have thick and smooth edge, which would protect your hand and serve long time for you. Two piece cooling racks could meet your different needs, such as baking, roasting, and grilling, cooling, and drying, ideal for cookies, meats and seafood. They are easy clean up and dishwasher safe to save your time and effort. SPECIFICATION Package: 2 Piece with same size racks Dimension: 16.6 x 11.6 x 0.75 inch Color: Natural Metal Silver Material: Pure Stainless Steel Craft: Mirror finish, Smooth edges, Seamless welding, Dense grid design Features: Non toxic, Heavy-duty, Great loading-bearing, Dishwasher safe, Oven Safe WHY MORE PEOPLE CHOOSE P&P CHEF STAINLESS STEEL BAKING RACK SET 1. Stainless steel baking rack is non teflon coating and non toxic leeching into food 2. Stainless steel cooling rack is dishwasher safe but aluminum not, always keep shiny after washing 3. Stainless steel roasting rack has smooth edge, mirror polish finish for less sticking to food 4. Stainless steel cooking rack cooks food more evenly, 3 cross bars with 6 support feet for hold heavy food stably 5. Stainless steel baking rack set fit various regular oven, and fit inside with 18”x 13” half cookie sheet USING INSTRUCTION 1. Please use soft dishcloth to clean the rack for the beauty of its surface. 2. Please clean and dry the rack after using for its durability. TIP for STICKLESS You can use a cooking spray or grease the rack with a little oil or butter to avoid food sticking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O-zjiVa9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P&P CHEF","source_asin":"B0B6B2LHB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6B2LHB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6B2LHB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
