window.products.push({"id":366302,"name":"DharmaCrafts Zafu and Zabuton Set (ZZSet) Meditation Cushions - Zen Home Dharma Design, Sacred Spaces (Dharma Cloud)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FGX41UJ3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About our Tibetan Splendor design Colored like precious jewels of deep burgundy and gold, our Tibetan Splendor cushions will transform your meditation space while you transform your mind. In the Tibetan Buddhist tradition, red is the color of fire and connotes the transformation of desire and attachment into discriminating wisdom. Yellow, the color of the earth, symbolizes groundedness and equanimity. It represents the transmutation of pride and self-importance into the wisdom of equality. Covers are 9 oz cotton twill. About our Dharma Cloud design Our gray and white Dharma Cloud Meditation Cushions will impart a still, tranquil quality to your meditation space. Dharma Cloud refers to highest level bodhisattvas who effortlessly and unceasingly radiate the dharma for the benefit of all beings. Covers are 100% brushed cotton. About our Stillness & Light designs (Ocean Moon, Forest Path, Mountain Temple) \" In front of the door lies The Land of Stillness and Light\" The Stillness and Light Collection is inspired by a Zen poem which describes the true nature of our mind. We chose tranquil, nighttime colors of forest, mountain and sea, and accented them with bands of gold and persimmon to represent pathways of moonlight. When our mind is clear, the whole universe is a reflection of our mind's true nature — stillness and light. Covers are 9 oz cotton twill. Handmade in USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FGX41UJ3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DharmaCrafts","source_asin":"B075FCDHV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FCDHV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FCDHV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
