window.products.push({"id":366400,"name":"Artisan 3-Piece Professional Baking Set with Half-Size Cookie Sheet Pan, Silicone Baking Mat with Red Border, and Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3sex1xlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great for entertaining, potlucks, and more, this Artisan 3-Piece Professional Baking Set makes preparing and transporting great meals, snacks, and desserts easy. Roast, and bake entrees and desserts for parties, everyday meals, and more with this heavy-duty 18-gauge aluminum baking pan with reusable silicone mat and reusable translucent plastic cover. Prepare delicious baked goods easier with this set, featuring a clear silicone mat made from a strong, flexible woven fiberglass core with a red border. Bake quickly and evenly with the aluminum pan's exceptional heat conductivity. Built with a reinforced rim, this pan resists warping and bending. Prepare your favorite dishes, cool, and seal in freshness for storing or transporting with the tight-fitting cover. This 3-piece set includes one 18-inch by 13-inch quarter-size cookie sheet with a matching 16.6-inch by 11-inch silicone baking mat and 18.5-inch by 13-inch cover that is 1.6 inches tall. Hand wash the pan with soap and water. Wipe the cover and mat clean with a soft, damp cloth. Store the mat flat or rolled. Do not use with cooking oils or sprays. Discard mat if it is cut or torn. Whether you are preparing small snacks, big meals and everything in between, great meals start with Artisan. This aluminum cookie sheet, silicone mat, and translucent cover are perfect for baking, roasting and freezing. Each set includes a 1-year manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3sex1xlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUCU","source_asin":"B004EHY5KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004EHY5KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004EHY5KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":366401,"name":"CAT BOOKENDS-White-Metal - for Book Shelves I Cat Shelf Decorations for Kitchen and Library I Book Stoppers for Home Office I Decorative to Hold Books","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MzyRepgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your bookshelf tell the story of who you are? Ours does. Beloved children’s books nestle next to our old college textbooks; thick classic novels rest between easy summertime reads and our favorite (wine-splashed) cookbooks. While we love e-readers as much as the next person, there’s just something about having books in the house that makes it feel like a home. Put these decorative Cat Bookends in a prominent place; they’re meant to make your best books shine. Perfect Gift for Avid Readers! These sturdy Cat bookends are ideal for your recipe books, yearbooks, baby memory books, photo albums, school or college books and more! Receive a cute cat black metal book mark with sweet red ribbon included with every purchase. Safe These pretty cat décor metal bookends have non-slip pads to safely handle any library of books without bending, tipping over or scuffing your shelf. High Quality Finish Durable Powder-Coated, Rust-Proof Finish. Durable non-stick pads protect surfaces. Durable non-slip pads on the bottom ensure that these bookends won’t scratch or scuff. Perfect for your books, magazines, DVDs, CDs, or video game cases Make your favorite books shine. When you’re searching for decorative Items for shelves: simply flank these book ends with colorful books and admire the pop of the cat design against the backdrop of a bookcase or the wall color behind your open shelving! Perfect for any kitchen or lounge. Desktop Organizer for your office or study. Put all your most used important books within arms reach. A perfect book holder for your work or study library. Be more organized while you work and have a fun decorative piece to show off too! Book Stoppers for Your Music, Craft and Family Rooms: Show off your album collection or fill the gap with card and board games, craft supplies CD’s or video games!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MzyRepgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08RRLM6JS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RRLM6JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RRLM6JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
