window.products.push({"id":366441,"name":"Café Valet Single Serve Coffee Maker, Brews 10 Ounces of Coffee or Hot Water, Compatible with Café Valet Coffee Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ctdoRWA0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great coffee, every single time. This coffee maker bundle gives you everything you need to make a great cup of coffee. The Café Valet set comes with one 10-ounce coffee maker and 84 French Vanilla flavor pre-packaged coffee packs. Each coffee pack comes complete with coffee grounds wrapped in a filter inside of a disposable brew basket. When you’re ready to make your coffee, simply slide the brew basket into your Café Valet coffee maker, pour 10 ounces of cold water into the water reservoir, place your favorite mug on the tray, and press the start button. In a few short minutes, you’ll have a hot cup of coffee waiting for you! To clean up, slide out the disposable brew basket and discard. You can also use the coffee maker to make hot water for cocoa, noodles, and tea. The small size and auto-shutoff feature makes the Café Valet Single Serve Coffee System a safe coffee making choice for homes, hotels, offices, and dorms. Over 100 million cups of coffee are brewed using the Café Valet Single Serve Coffee System every year, making it your perfect solution for delicious, affordable, and mess-free coffee. That's Café Valet!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ctdoRWA0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafe Valet","source_asin":"B07PFY2WR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFY2WR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFY2WR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":366442,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 2 lbs Rare Assorted Tumbled Stone Mix from Africa - 0.10\" to 0.25\" avg. - Bulk Polished Gemstone Rock Supplies for Crafts, Reiki, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ICWbukL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fantasia is a USA based mining company located in Massillon Ohio providing good old fashioned American quality control to ensure every stone sent is beautiful. Fantasia starts with premium grade African rough stones which are tumbled using Fantasia's proprietary tumbling techniques. This brings out the naturally beautiful colors, patterns, shine, luster and energy in every stone.Some of the many stones used in this mix include: Amethyst, Apricot Quartz, Banded Jasper, Black and Cream Chert, Bloodstone, Blue Chert, Blue Howlite, Blue Tiger Eye, Brecciated Jasper, Carnelian, Chevron Amethyst, Dark Purple Amethyst, Dragon Stone, Epidote, Fine Line Agate, Flower Jasper, Gold Tiger Eye, Green Chalcedony, Green Chert, Grey Botswana Agate, Guinea Fowl, Nguni Jasper, Picture Stone, Rainbow Jasper, Red and White Jasper, Red Carnelian, Red Jasper, Red Lined Agate, Red Tiger Eye, Rose Quartz, Satin Leaf Jasper, Silver Leaf Jasper, Snowflake Epidote, Sodalite, Speartite, Unakite, Unpolished Turquenite, Voegesite, White Howlite, Wine Red Quartz and MORE!Your order will contain multiple pieces with varying stone types, sizes, shapes and patterns as shown in the images which is equal to or greater than the total weight purchased. In most cases the size of each stone is between 0.10\" to 0.25\" each, but it is possible to get some stones smaller or larger than these averages. While most stones in this mix are undyed it is possible to receive dyed blue howlite in this mix.VERY IMPORTANT: With all tumbled stones there are some material types which will have imperfections even after being meticulously tumbled due to their natural characteristics. While rare, due to the fragile nature of tumbled stones it is also possible minor chipping may be found on some of the stones received. The number of acceptable imperfections is relative to the material type and the grade being purchased and some minor imperfections should be expected as shown in our images.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ICWbukL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B07YSZDYBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSZDYBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSZDYBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
