window.products.push({"id":366483,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. Oversized Throw Blanket for Full and Queen beds, Reversible Soft Microfleece Sherpa Blanket, Warm Blanket for Winter (98 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AdhtD9VJL._AC_SL1422_.jpg","description":"What is Included: One high quality oversized Full and Queen bed size bed blanket is 98 in wide x 98 in long. It is a reversible blanket with smooth and soft microfleece on one side and warm and cozy faux Sherpa on the other side. This allows you to experience two different surfaces with the added warmth of Sherpa. It is truly an oversized blanket as most Full and Queen sized blankets are 90 x 90. Our blanket is 98 inches x 98 inches. Southshore Fine Linens Sell oversized Bedding. This Sherpa blanket is extremely versatile. You can use it as a bed throw blanket or simply to layer your bed with other bedding or snuggle with your loved ones as an oversized couch throw blanket on your sofa. It can also be used outdoors. People take them to the parks and picnics, and it also makes a beautiful gift for people of all ages and gender. Its Simple yet elegant design can be used in any type of room décor, from farmhouse to shabby chic to modern contemporary room decor. Create memories with this Full Sherpa Blanket and Queen Sherpa Blanket and snuggle in softness with your family and watch your favorite movies. These extra-large blankets are the softest blankets. Elevate your house with these soft blankets & throws. These Sherpa Blankets are perfect for anyone in your family, whether kids’ beds, girls’ room, boys’ room, or the master bedroom, they fit right in. Equally useful for adults, teens, and kids. You will want to snuggle all day with these Blankets Premium Quality: Reversible Sherpa Fleece Blanket and throws are made with Highest Quality Of 100% Microfiber Polyester yarn. This means there is no shrinkage or color fading. These blankets and throws retain their shape overtime. These ultra-Plush and soft throw blankets are easier to maintain than cotton blankets. When it comes to quality, these are not cheap blankets at all. These Sherpa and microfleece blankets are easy to fold & store as well. They do not need ironing either. The Southshore Guarantee: Our Plush Reversible Sherpa and microfleece blanket throw and bed blankets comes with a worry-free One-year Warranty. When you Purchase a Southshore product, you become part of our family. We offer 30-day 100% Money-Back Guarantee. We are a customer focused small business out of Las Vegas, Nevada and will do our absolute best to take care of you. Easy Care Bedding: Machine Wash, Tumble Dry, do not use fabric softener or bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AdhtD9VJL._AC_SL1422_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B09N6RNCCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6RNCCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6RNCCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
