window.products.push({"id":366674,"name":"Paddywax Candles Spark Collection, Naturally Scented Candle, 10.6 Ounces, 10.6-Ounce, Believe (Gingerbread & Vanilla)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-eLIPUKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With our Spark Collection of scented jar candles, you can responsibly fill your house with clean, fresh, natural scents. Our fun and modern take on prayer candles, each clear glass vessel is filled with colored wax and printed with encouragements. No matter the occasion, a large candle from our Spark Collection is sure to spark positive intentions and leave a lasting smile. Our jarred scented candle comes in scents like lavender, cactus flower, patchouli, eucalyptus santal, and more.Each of our aromatic candles is poured into a recyclable glass, ceramic, porcelain, or painted concrete jar to help you make every aspect of your life more earth-friendly. Use one as a bathroom candle, kitchen candle, bedroom candle, or living-room candle to bring a welcoming aroma to any room in your home. Be sure to trim the wick before a new burn for a contained flame and an even burn.Every aspect of Paddywax Candles—from the materials to the shapes—is designed in Nashville, Tennessee. Each cozy candle is hand poured at our Nashville factory, where we combine the soy-wax blend with a lovely fragrance and a safe cotton wick so that it will burn beautifully. After you finish burning your long-lasting scented candle, freeze the jar overnight to remove the wax and wick. You can use the clean container as a succulent planter, pencil cup, bowl, sugar container, knickknack holder, bathroom canister, or laundry-bead holder. The possibilities are endless!Paddywax is an artisan company specializing in candles and diffusers made with quality materials, inspiring color palettes, and intriguing fragrances to set the tone in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-eLIPUKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax","source_asin":"B09MK3MDXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MK3MDXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MK3MDXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
