window.products.push({"id":366756,"name":"Remeel Cooking Thermometer Kitchen Thermometer Meat Thermometer Fast Instant Read Digital Food Thermometer with Magnet for Grilling BBQ Steak Baking B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lmANKDgwL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"Remeel Meat thermometer is a must have little tool in your kitchen as you are a steak lover or crazy about baking. The accurate temperature helps you to check if the food is all well without any guessing SPECIFICATION Temperature Range : -4℉ to 482℉(-20℃ to 250℃) Operational Temperature Range : 14℉ to 122℉(-10℃ to 50℃) Temperature Accuracy: 0.1 ℃/ ºF LCD Screen Size : 28.5mm x 13.5mm Battery : 1 x CR2032 (Included) Probe Material : Food grade 304 stainless steel Auto-off Feature : 5 Mins without any operation and ≤3℃ temperature changes HOW TO USE Step 1: SWITCH ON Switch on the kitchen thermometer by removing the battery insulator and press the orange button. The current room temperature displays Step 2: CONVERT UNITS(℉/℃)  ℃ is default unit at the first use. Turn on the digital thermometer, during LCD full display mode, press and hold the orange button to select the desire measuring unit. Without any operations in 3 sec, the unit will be selected as showed on the LCD Step 3: MEASURE Simply insert the probe into the testing objects to get the temperature HOLD FUNCTION Press the orange button, the temperature will enter reading lock mode with ”HOLD” sign on the LCD display WHAT IS DIFFERENT FROM OTHERS 1: Magnet Design - This meat thermometer can be attached to the surface of fridge, grill, pan rack almost everything metal with digital thermometer's magnetic back, the elegant and hole-hanging design makes Remeel food thermometer easy to store and can always keep the probe clean 2. Foldable Design - 90° foldable design allows you read the temperature directly and much more easy without bending your body 3. One button operation helps you easy to find the ON/OFF button and read the degree on the digital thermometer's screen when you cook in the dark or in hurry, fabullous to use when you have a BBQ party","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lmANKDgwL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Remeel","source_asin":"B07Z9JDRMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z9JDRMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z9JDRMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
