window.products.push({"id":366771,"name":"COOK WITH COLOR Roll Up Dish Rack- Over The Sink Mat for Drying Dishes - Silicone Wrapped Stainless Steel Rods (15\" x 17.5\") - Versatile Roll Up Trive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2GT6RH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUST HAVE KITCHEN TOOL: Our over the sink roll up rack features a flexible design for saving space in any kitchen. This is the perfect alternative to traditional drying mats and racks which take up much needed counter space. The silicone edges of the rack ensures a sturdy and non-slip grip over the sink. The rack is sturdy enough to be used for delicate stemware or heavy cookware. VERSATILE TOOL: Our roll up drying mat can be used for much more than drying dishes and pots. Use as an over the sink colander for drying fruits and vegetables; Use as a trivet to protect counters from hot pots and pans; Use with a cutting board over the sink to extend counter space. We are sure you will love this kitchen roll up rack whatever you use it for! LARGE SIZE: The drying rack kitchen mat measures 15\" by 17.5\" which is the ideal size for standard kitchen sinks to sit over a portion of your sink. This allows your dishes to drain while continuing to use the sink. Ensure your sink width is no more than 16.5\" before purchasing our roll up kitchen drying rack. FOOD SAFE MATERIALS: Our roll up drying rack is made with strong stainless steel rods and secured with silicone edges. All materials are BPA free and safe to use with food so you can use as a drying rack trivet or colander for fresh produce. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: At Cook with Color our number one goal is customer satisfaction. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us with any issues, questions or comments so we can ensure that your Cook with Color order experience adds just the right color and taste!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2GT6RH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOK WITH COLOR","source_asin":"B0BM9J13T7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9J13T7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9J13T7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":366772,"name":"mDesign Steel Over Door Hanging Shower Caddy Storage Organizer with 2 Baskets, 6 Hooks - Shelf Rack for Bathroom - Holds Shampoo, Conditioner, Soap, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fA-ZC8lbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STORAGE MADE SIMPLE: Keep bathing essentials close at hand with this convenient shower door caddy; It features 2 shelf baskets, 2 large hooks, and 4 small hooks to hold face towels, loofahs or razors; Two strong suction cups keep caddy firmly in place in wet or dry bathroom environments; The open grid design allows for maximum water drainage and air circulation so that items dry quickly EASY INSTALLATION: Hang this convenient organizer over shower doors for instant storage; The suction cups keep the caddy secure and in place - clean and dry the surface area before pressing the suction cups firmly to the surface; Suction cups work on smooth nonporous surfaces such as glass, tile, mirrors and fiberglass; Perfect for home, apartments, condos, dorms, RVs and campers; Arms extend and rotate to perfectly fit your space - Easy-to-follow instructions are included FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE: This 2 tier caddy organizer has space to store a wide variety of products in multiple shapes and sizes; Built-in hooks for washcloths, back brushes, loofahs, poufs, pumice stones, razors and more; The large baskets are great for storing shampoo, conditioner, body wash, hand soap, razors, shaving cream, oils, facial cleansers, leave-in conditioners and salt scrubs; Two strong suction cups keep this organizer caddy in place and secure QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made from sturdy steel wire with a durable finish; Plastic suction cups; Suction cups adhere best to clean smooth, non-porous surfaces; Easy Care - Clean with damp cloth THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Measures 6\" x 9.3\" x 12\" high; Arms extend from 11.1\" to 16.6\" high; Fits over shower and interior doors up to 1.4\" / 3.6cm thick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fA-ZC8lbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07PN7581Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-366772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PN7581Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PN7581Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
